{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2-1/pulls/234","id":4518348906,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSVNUqs8AAAABDVCIag","html_url":"https://github.com/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2-1/pull/234","diff_url":"https://github.com/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2-1/pull/234.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2-1/pull/234.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2-1/issues/234","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2-1/pulls/234/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2-1/pulls/234/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2-1/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2-1/issues/234/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2-1/statuses/b09f4b553f385573e99d870f53310e4ef3702510","number":234,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(make-doom-for-mips): don't treat a stale /tmp/frame.bmp as a fresh frame","user":{"login":"hjc-puro","id":147075899,"node_id":"U_kgDOCMQzOw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147075899?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro","html_url":"https://github.com/hjc-puro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"My bot wants to propose a grader change to make-doom-for-mips. My understanding of how grading currently works is\n\n1. We start the doom boot process (`node vm.js`) and poll for the existence of `/tmp/frame.bmp`, which is the signal that the game has booted.\n2. Once the file exists we sleep 1s, kill the boot, and check stdout for `I_InitGraphics: DOOM screen size: w x h: 320 x 200`.\n\nHowever a frequent agent behavior is to run `node vm.js` to test its work before submission, which leaves a `/tmp/frame.bmp` behind at the start of grading. This means the poll returns immediately and doom boot is killed about a second after it starts, while it's still in R_Init and hasn't printed the I_InitGraphics line yet (that shows up right before the first frame, ~2.3s in). So a correct build fails the stdout check and gets 0, while the two frame tests happily pass on the old frame. The gold solve.sh never runs vm.js so gold/null validation doesn't catch this. This was also raised by Shaun Smith (@evalstate) in #161.\n\nMy bot went through the [astra trajectories](https://hub.harborframework.com/jobs/17d1a7f6-3339-4670-8b70-3b145979f57f) for this task on the harbor hub and found 18/25 trials had this behavior [[example](https://hub.harborframework.com/jobs/17d1a7f6-3339-4670-8b70-3b145979f57f/trials/e899ef32-01e5-448d-bd96-7969ff17ad52#49), [its verifier stdout](https://hub.harborframework.com/api/trials/e899ef32-01e5-448d-bd96-7969ff17ad52/files/verifier/test-stdout.txt?jobId=17d1a7f6-3339-4670-8b70-3b145979f57f)]. Across all the public leaderboard jobs it could read, 30/36 trials with a frame matching the reference scored 0 this way. The one astra pass ran the verifier in 1.15s, ie same stale frame, that build just happened to print the banner within the 1s.\n\nThe change deletes `/tmp/frame.bmp` before starting the doom booter, and waits for the I_InitGraphics line with its own timeout instead of asserting on whatever was in stdout when we killed it. Tested in the task image with a correct build: stale frame + old test fails as above, stale frame + new test passes, clean + either test passes.\n\nFixes #161\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-13T10:58:12Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T23:54:41Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"f5d33ae6eb43eb80e301f2701b2bc832a1f37ba0","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"hjc-puro:fix/make-doom-for-mips-stale-frame","ref":"fix/make-doom-for-mips-stale-frame","repo":{"id":1368299276,"node_id":"R_kgDOUY6XDA","name":"terminal-bench-2-1","full_name":"hjc-puro/terminal-bench-2-1","owner":{"login":"hjc-puro","id":147075899,"node_id":"U_kgDOCMQzOw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147075899?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro","html_url":"https://github.com/hjc-puro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hjc-puro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":true,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Terminal-Bench 2.1","homepage":"https://hub.harborframework.com/datasets/terminal-bench/terminal-bench-2-1/latest","language":null,"visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_coun